- Evidence tier (A-D) per pattern x direction from Bulkowski ranks / LMW / Savin et al.; C capped at B, D at C
- Timeframe stack: Daily anchor, Weekly context, 4H secondary, 1H entry-only (C unless Daily trend agrees)
- New detectors: Three Rising Valleys / Falling Peaks, VCP / Tight Base (bull only)
- FAILED status for breakouts that close back inside within 10 bars (recorded, not dropped)
- Prior-trend and holding-horizon fields; FORMING capped at B (not activated)
- Forward ledger: every activated breakout scored +1 ATR before -0.75 ATR within 20 bars, long/short separate
